      <chord name="C7"/>A<chord name="F"/>mazing <chord name="F7"/>grace! how <chord name="Bb"/>sweet the <chord name="F"/>sound, <chord name="C7"/>That <chord name="F"/>saved a <chord name="G7"/>wretch like <chord name="C"/>me<chord name="F"/>!<chord name="C"/><br/>
