      <chord name="C7"/><chord name="F"/>Through <chord name="F7"/><chord name="Bb"/>many <chord name="F"/><chord name="C7"/>dangers, <chord name="F"/><chord name="G7"/>toils, <chord name="C"/><chord name="F"/>and <chord name="C"/>snares,<br/>
